2a:["$","p","16",{"className":"text-[#839BBE] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["All providers use modern AMD EPYC Genoa or Intel Sapphire Rapids CPUs with DDR5 RAM. Hetzner leads in raw I/O (avg. 1.8 GB/s sequential read), while Scaleway delivers the lowest network jitter (<0.3ms). Contabo’s new Warsaw DC shows 12% better latency to Eastern Europe than its older Nuremberg node. OVHcloud’s Paris and Strasbourg locations offer dual-stack BGP routing and optional DDoS protection at no extra cost. All support IPv6-only deployments and offer private networks (free on Hetzner & Scaleway; €2.50/mo on OVHcloud & Contabo)."]}]
